1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:07,350
Slide 35 illustrates "BALANCING AUTONOMY AND CONTROL" across our 3-tier governance matrix.

2
00:00:08,050 --> 00:00:22,070
Look at Card 1: "TIER 1: FULL AUTONOMY." Low-risk, reversible tasks like summarizing documents, tagging emails, and organizing folders run with 100% autonomy.

3
00:00:22,770 --> 00:00:35,250
Look at Card 2: "TIER 2: NOTIFY & LOG." Medium-risk tasks like drafting client emails or creating calendar invites execute automatically but notify the user with an undo option.

4
00:00:35,950 --> 00:00:50,370
And look at Card 3: "TIER 3: STRICT HUMAN APPROVAL." High-risk actions like financial transactions, database deletions, or code deployments require explicit human cryptographic sign-off.

5
00:00:51,070 --> 00:00:57,000
This 3-tier matrix eliminates catastrophic risks while preserving massive operational speed!

